UTDIR TAG ARM) and also handles real/semisynthetic. Remaining: matrix (5 workers 5-9 running, ~175/504 at 03:30; relaunch as they exit at ~tmax 13000 s), then real runs + C7 + matrix_facts + summarise_gap; summarise_decisions currently synthetic-only (needs a real-arm variant: rep=-1 pool, pool-bootstrap CIs). Leave results/.hold empty unless a job is writing into results/.\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 6\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-fe9f8612c4\",\n          \"state\": \"running\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 7\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-fc351cf1d4\",\n          \"state\": \"running\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 8\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-bb63920e1b\",\n          \"state\": \"running\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 9\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-a896a1ab23\",\n          \"state\": \"running\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 3\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-a1f6a53a23\",\n          \"state\": \"torn-down\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 4\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-1e5e103dd0\",\n          \"state\": \"torn-down\"\n          \"note\": \"syn_gap grid\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-7b91fccbdc\",\n          \"state\": \"succeeded\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 1\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-c42e40415b\",\n          \"state\": \"succeeded\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 2\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-ba13cce9c4\",\n          \"state\": \"succeeded\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 3\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-819a6eb116\",\n          \"state\": \"succeeded\"\n          \"note\": \"matrix worker 4\",\n          \"ref\": \"job-14fb5b2d9b\",\n          \"state\": \"succeeded\"\n          \"note\": \"protocols synthetic (C5/C6)\",\n   \n[truncated for publication]", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "9d154dd0-de52-55ed-a6d4-4e546e0a6ab2", "at": 1795674711.867179, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 28530, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": 